{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"well-call","skinId":"paperbook","adapter":"legacy","sourceHashes":{"rules":"9514d7c390d00cb405bb2096e68944ae541e582c79825f874ededdc84d2aa9ee","skin":"6b6bda615bcc1a7c7b3123a1f08693e4d6f4cf15fa12ffab6d50cbd02a94b196"},"rules":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"well-call","title":"井口边的求助","kind":"response","order":12,"location":"社区 · 污水井外围","description":"发现有人在污水井内遇险。留在外围联系专业救援，也提醒旁人别靠近。","safety":"你是不具备救援装备和能力的旁观者。保持自身安全，不进入有限空间；及时联系119、120。这里的电话仅为离线演示，不会真实拨出。","briefing":"你手持手机。提醒右侧旁观者退到外围，并联络119、120。","objects":[{"id":"well","label":"危险井口","input":"tap"},{"id":"person","label":"旁观者","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["bystander-back"],"missFeedback":"旁观者回到原位。请重新提醒他，将他移到右下方外围区。"},{"id":"fire-call","label":"模拟联系119","input":"tap","disabledWhen":["fire-called"]},{"id":"medical-call","label":"模拟联系120","input":"tap","disabledWhen":["medical-called"]}],"goals":[{"id":"bystander-back","label":"劝退旁人","object":"person"},{"id":"fire-connected","label":"接通119","object":"fire-call"},{"id":"fire-called","label":"联系119","object":"fire-call"},{"id":"medical-connected","label":"接通120","object":"medical-call"},{"id":"medical-called","label":"联系120","object":"medical-call"},{"id":"waiting-confirmed","label":"外围待援","object":"well"}],"interactions":[{"id":"back","source":"person","mode":"drop","target":"perimeter","grants":["bystander-back"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"back","feedback":"已提醒旁观者退到外围。他回应：“好，我不靠近，也提醒其他人。”","hint":"你手持手机。提醒右侧旁观者远离井口，将他移到右下方外围区。"},{"id":"dial-119","source":"fire-call","mode":"tap","grants":["fire-connected"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"dial-119","feedback":"模拟119已接通。请根据现场信息，说明地点和需要的救援。","hint":"点击手机上的119消防救援，再根据现场信息报告地点和险情。"},{"id":"report-fire","source":"fire-call","mode":"tap","choice":"报告：阳光小区东侧污水井，1人井内遇险","requires":["fire-connected"],"unless":["fire-called"],"grants":["fire-called"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"reply-fire","feedback":"119：地点和险情已记录。请继续留在外围，不要自行下井。"},{"id":"dial-120","source":"medical-call","mode":"tap","grants":["medical-connected"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"dial-120","feedback":"模拟120已接通。请如实说明已知的人数和情况，不猜测伤情。","hint":"点击手机上的120医疗急救，如实报告已知人数和状况。"},{"id":"report-medical","source":"medical-call","mode":"tap","choice":"阳光小区东侧污水井，1人遇险，伤情暂不清楚","requires":["medical-connected"],"unless":["medical-called"],"grants":["medical-called"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"reply-medical","feedback":"120：阳光小区东侧污水井、1人遇险，情况已记录。请留在外围，保持联系。"},{"id":"confirm-perimeter","source":"well","mode":"tap","choice":"别靠近，我们留在外围等专业人员","requires":["bystander-back","fire-called","medical-called"],"unless":["waiting-confirmed"],"grants":["waiting-confirmed"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"acknowledge","feedback":"旁观者：“明白，我留在外围，也提醒其他人。”求助练习完成，井口仍然危险。"},{"id":"inspect","source":"well","mode":"tap","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"observe","feedback":"正在外围观察：井内有人遇险，伤情暂不清楚。不要进入井内，留在外围联络专业救援。"},{"id":"pull-in","source":"person","mode":"drop","target":"well","grants":[],"outcome":"danger","animation":"no-entry","feedback":"不要进入井内施救。先保证自己安全，由专业人员救援。"},{"id":"vague-fire","source":"fire-call","mode":"tap","choice":"只说“有人出事了”，不说明位置","requires":["fire-connected"],"unless":["fire-called"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply-fire","feedback":"还缺准确位置。查看现场信息：阳光小区东侧污水井，再说明1人井内遇险。"},{"id":"guess-medical","source":"medical-call","mode":"tap","choice":"没有看清，也直接说“他没有受伤”","requires":["medical-connected"],"unless":["medical-called"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply-medical","feedback":"不要把不确定的情况说成事实。你在外围，只知道1人井内遇险，伤情暂不清楚。"},{"id":"approach-after-call","source":"well","mode":"tap","choice":"已经打过电话，可以走近去看了","requires":["bystander-back","fire-called","medical-called"],"unless":["waiting-confirmed"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"acknowledge","feedback":"打过电话不代表现场已经安全。继续提醒旁人别靠近，留在外围等待。"}],"risk":{"mode":"elapsed","seconds":90,"initial":0,"warningAt":65,"peakFeedback":"本关没有灾害倒数，请继续练习。"},"completion":{"requires":["bystander-back","fire-connected","fire-called","medical-connected","medical-called","waiting-confirmed"],"settleMs":1800,"title":"求助已发出，继续外围待援","status":"待援","summary":"不具备安全救援条件时，不要进入污水井等有限空间。联系119、120，说明位置和险情，劝阻旁人靠近，在外围等待专业救援。井口仍然危险。"},"coaching":{"context":"现场信息：阳光小区东侧 · 污水井。已知1人井内遇险，伤情暂不清楚。你是手持手机的求助者，右侧人物是旁观者。","tasks":["bystander-back","fire-called","medical-called"],"reminders":["提醒旁观者退到右下方外围区；到位后他会回应你。不要把他拖向井口。","点击井口只是在外围观察，不代表下井。手机上的119、120均为模拟联络，不会真实拨号。","根据现场信息报告位置和已知状况，不猜测伤情。两通电话均完成后，继续提醒旁人保持外围待援。","练习用时不是救援到达时间。求助后井口仍然危险。"],"conversations":[{"id":"fire-report","requires":["fire-connected"],"unless":["fire-called"],"caption":"应急演练 · 模拟119","title":"119 · 说明地点与险情","reference":"现场位置：阳光小区东侧污水井。已知1人井内遇险，你没有下井救援的装备。","prompt":"接警人员：具体在哪里，发生了什么事？","choices":["report-fire","vague-fire"]},{"id":"medical-report","requires":["medical-connected"],"unless":["medical-called"],"caption":"应急演练 · 模拟120","title":"120 · 如实说明人员状况","reference":"位置仍是阳光小区东侧污水井。已知1人井内遇险；你在外围，无法确认伤情。","prompt":"急救接线人员：有几人遇险？你知道他的伤情吗？","choices":["guess-medical","report-medical"]},{"id":"perimeter-check","requires":["bystander-back","fire-called","medical-called"],"unless":["waiting-confirmed"],"caption":"现场提醒 · 继续外围待援","title":"电话打完了，也别靠近","reference":"你已联络119、120，旁观者也已退到外围。但专业救援尚未到达。","prompt":"旁观者：“电话打完了，要不要走近井口看看？”你会怎样提醒他？","choices":["confirm-perimeter","approach-after-call"]}]}},"skin":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"paperbook","world":{"width":720,"height":1280},"framing":{"sceneBounds":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":720,"h":1320},"critical":{"x":70,"y":260,"w":600,"h":966}},"assets":{"well-room":{"src":"/levels/display-adaptation/well-call-backdrop.webp","alpha":false,"sceneBounds":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":720,"h":1320}},"well-opening":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/well-opening.png","alpha":true},"citizen-worried":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-worried.png","alpha":true},"citizen-focused":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-focused.png","alpha":true},"citizen-panicked":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-panicked.png","alpha":true},"citizen-relieved":{"src":"